[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6089811414","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124338#issuecomment-6089811414","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124338","id":6089811414,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABavsl1g","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-09T21:47:46Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T21:47:46Z","body":"This seems to disable all snapping options when opening preexisting projects. New projects show the defaults enabled, though. This however could be a side effect of my PR, and it was showing them enabled when in fact it was disabling them.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"422\" height=\"259\" alt=\"Screenshot_20261009_183808\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/47484acd-3de6-47a4-9728-1e345d1df3eb\" />","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6089811414/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6091119384","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124338#issuecomment-6091119384","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124338","id":6091119384,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaw8bGA","user":{"login":"gabcont","id":143468139,"node_id":"U_kgDOCI0maw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143468139?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont","html_url":"https://github.com/gabcont","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-09T23:38:41Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T23:38:41Z","body":"> This seems to disable all snapping options when opening preexisting projects. New projects show the defaults enabled, though. This however could be a side effect of my PR, and it was showing them enabled when in fact it was disabling them.\r\n\r\nI just tested it and yes, it seems that it is a side effect, canvas_item_editor_plugin's set_state() handles the new bit mask and basically completely deprecates previous boolean implementation, when a pre 4.8 project loads it does know what to do with a bool, losing all the configs.\r\n\r\nSo, we could add a little bitwise trickery to convert bools to the bitmask, or ditch the bitmask and go back to booleans.\r\n\r\nWhat do you think is the best approach? @YeldhamDev \r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6091119384/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6092257972","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124338#issuecomment-6092257972","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124338","id":6092257972,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABayB6tA","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-10T01:37:36Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T01:37:36Z","body":"> So, we could add a little bitwise trickery to convert bools to the bitmask, or ditch the bitmask and go back to booleans.\r\n\r\nI do believe that the internal bitmask implementation is cleaner due to reduced boilerplate, so as long as the bitwise trickery is not too hacky, we could go with that.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6092257972/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6097539667","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124338#issuecomment-6097539667","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124338","id":6097539667,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABa3ESUw","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-10T12:34:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T12:34:05Z","body":"What's the point of storing the values as \"bitmask\" if they are still separate entries?\r\n<img width=\"357\" height=\"115\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b7d11147-a07b-46d1-8a40-3cd5fc1c4905\" />\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6097539667/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6100549695","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124338#issuecomment-6100549695","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124338","id":6100549695,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABa58APw","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-10T18:02:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-10T18:02:09Z","body":"I was referring to _internal_ way to set the snapping, the `CanvasItemManipulator.set_snap()` function. As for storing them in the file, I would still recommend using booleans, to keep compatibility.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6100549695/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6105831312","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124338#issuecomment-6105831312","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124338","id":6105831312,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABa--XkA","user":{"login":"gabcont","id":143468139,"node_id":"U_kgDOCI0maw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143468139?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont","html_url":"https://github.com/gabcont","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-11T05:27:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T05:27:56Z","body":"Back to booleans for storage.\r\n```\r\nstate[\"snap_node_parent\"] = static_cast<bool>(snap_mode & CanvasItemManipulator::SNAP_NODE_PARENT);\r\n```\r\n\r\nAdded a simple `* CanvasItemManipulator::SNAP_NODE_MODE` at the start, that's all the trickery.\r\n```\r\nif (state.has(\"snap_node_anchors\")) {\r\n\t\tint val = static_cast<int>(state[\"snap_node_anchors\"]) * CanvasItemManipulator::SNAP_NODE_ANCHORS;\r\n\t\tint snap_mode = (ci_manipulator->get_snap_mode() & ~CanvasItemManipulator::SNAP_NODE_ANCHORS) | val;\r\n\t\tci_manipulator->set_snap_mode(snap_mode);\r\n\t\tint idx = smartsnap_config_popup->get_item_index(SNAP_USE_NODE_ANCHORS);\r\n\t\tsmartsnap_config_popup->set_item_checked(idx, static_cast<bool>(val));\r\n\t}\r\n```\r\n\r\nHave in mind that now saved projects with bitmask values are unsupported, so projects that were saved during testing of the bitmask storage will behave weird. Be sure to test using new projects or projects untouched by the interim storage method.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6105831312/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6155051871","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124338#issuecomment-6155051871","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124338","id":6155051871,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABbt6jXw","user":{"login":"YeldhamDev","id":30739239,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNzM5MjM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30739239?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev","html_url":"https://github.com/YeldhamDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YeldhamDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-13T20:57:34Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T20:57:34Z","body":"Now those commits need to be squashed: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/workflows/creating_pull_requests.html#the-interactive-rebase","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6155051871/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6157752101","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124338#issuecomment-6157752101","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124338","id":6157752101,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABbwfXJQ","user":{"login":"gabcont","id":143468139,"node_id":"U_kgDOCI0maw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143468139?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont","html_url":"https://github.com/gabcont","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabcont/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-13T23:59:11Z","updated_at":"2026-10-13T23:59:11Z","body":"> Now those commits need to be squashed: https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/workflows/creating_pull_requests.html#the-interactive-rebase\r\n\r\nDone, I left it as 2 commits as they, although related, are two different bugs.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6157752101/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"ho